== partial('partials/navbar')

.hero.features
  .container
    h2 Nitrous Development Platform
    h4.subtitle
      | Zero installation. Spend time coding, not configuring software.

.hero.features-list
  .container
    .flex-list
      .flex-item
        h4.terminal Built-in Terminal
        p
          | Install libraries, manage dependencies and execute scripts in your project with terminal and full root access.

      .flex-item
        h4.collab Collaboration
        p
          | Code collaboratively in real-time. Get help from a friend or co-worker, and code directly on the same machine in the cloud.

      .flex-item
        h4.github GitHub Integration
        p
          | Connect your GitHub account, pull repos, push code, and stay productive wherever you are.

      .flex-item
        h4.snapshots Snapshots
        p
          | Take snapshots to preserve the state of your project's environment, and revert back to them at any time.

      .flex-item
        h4.docker Powered by Docker
        p
          | Create & develop on multiple projects within a workstation, or create custom project using Docker images.

      .flex-item
        h4.ide Powerful Web IDE
        p
          | Edit code from any modern web browser. Split screen editing, go-to-file, powerful search, themes and file upload functionality.

      .flex-item
        h4.ssl SSL Data Encryption
        p
          | All of your information is encrypted and transmitted securely using the Secure Sockets Layer (SSL) protocol.

      .flex-item
        h4.backup Backup & Redundancy
        p
          | Never worry about losing your work because of a coffee spill or stolen laptop. Your projects are in the cloud, in military-grade secure facilities.

      .flex-item
        h4.data Dedicated Cloud Machines
        p
          | Every user operates within their own isolated environment and cannot interact with other applications or areas of the system.


.hero.featurette
  .container
    .row
      .col-xs-12.col-md-6
        h2 Self-service Dashboard
        p
          | Easily create and manage new projects, or load your own using Docker images.
        p
          | Access your app's public preview or SSH URLs, and invite others to collaborate on your project.
      .col-xs-12.col-md-6
        <image here>

.hero.featurette
  .container
    .row
      .col-xs-12.col-md-6
        <image here>
      .col-xs-12.col-md-6
        h2 Collaboration
        p
          | blah blah collaborate stuff

.hero.featurette.full
  .container
    h2 Best-in-class Cloud IDE
    h4.subtitle
      | Multiple layouts, smart auto-complete, live collaboration, and power-tools that will put your desktop code editor to shame.

    p
      | <IDE images>

.hero.apps
  .container
    .col-xs-12.col-md-6
      h4.nitrogen
        | Nitrogen Plugin for Atom

      h6 Manage your cloud environments
      p
        | Nitrogen (available for Windows, OS X, and Linux) lets you manage your Nitrous projects running in the cloud.

      h6 Sync files, use your favorite editor
      p
        | Sync files between Nitrous and desktop computer, allowing you to edit files using Atom or your text editor of choice.

      a.btn.btn-primary.with-icon.nitrogen-browser
        | Install Nitrogen

    .col-xs-12.col-md-6
      h4.chrome
        | Nitrogen Chrome App

      h6 Great for Chromebooks
      p
        | Written from scratch with performance in mind, Nitrous for Chrome will profoundly enhance your coding experience, whichever device you use.

      h6 Native Keyboard Shortcuts
      p
        | Nitrous for Chrome takes advantage of the freedom offered by Chrome apps, and provides a "native-like" coding experience. Learn more.

      a.btn.btn-primary.with-icon.chrome
        | Chrome Web Store



